{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103452","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103452/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103452/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103452/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103452","id":2889346758,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6sN-7G","number":103452,"title":"AnimationPlayer saving unset visualshader floatparameter as 'null' instead of '0'.","user":{"login":"GivenFlesh","id":64552095,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTUyMDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64552095?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GivenFlesh","html_url":"https://github.com/GivenFlesh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GivenFlesh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GivenFlesh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GivenFlesh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GivenFlesh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GivenFlesh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GivenFlesh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GivenFlesh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GivenFlesh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GivenFlesh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-03-02T05:48:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T23:46:59Z","closed_at":"2025-03-04T23:10:11Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - \n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen creating a new track in AnimationPlayer for a visualshader's parameters, if a value has not been explicitly given a default, or the user has not typed the value '0' first, then the default value, despite displaying as zero, is actually saved as null. this prevents the track from actually animating to or from this number, but the value still displays as 'zero' in editor. This can be worked around if a user knows what's happened, but is not intuitive. It also does not happen with a shader, only visualshader.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a sprite2d or texturerect\nCreate a new shader material\nCreate and attach a new visual shader\nIn that visualshader, create a floatparameter and attach it to color.\n\nCreate an animationplayer\nCreate a new animation\nLocate the created visualshader parameter, you may create a range, but do not put in a default value.\nClick the keyframe button before setting a value of any type.\n\nIf you now create a second keyframe of any value elsewhere on the timeline, it will not animate between them, because the value is null, and this can be confirmed by looking at the raw text of the saved scene.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[minimum_project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19041863/minimum_project.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103452/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103452/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}